+315. Average Ground Elevation. The elevation of the main finished grade at the front of a structure. 
+ 
+ARTICLE III                                                          DEFINITIONS 
+  
+3-5 
+316. Bed and Breakfast Facility.  A residential-type lodging facility having no more than ten  (10) 
