+        <p id="isPasted">Yuletide Golf Cart Parade: Saturday, December 20, 2025, at 1:00 p.m.&nbsp;</p><p>Get ready to rev up your golf carts for the highly anticipated 2025 Yuletide Christmas Golf Cart Parade!&nbsp;<br>The parade kicks off on Saturday, December 20, 2025, at 1 p.m.</p><p>If you&apos;re joining in on the parade fun, make sure to check in with the Keep Surfside Beach Committee upon arrival.&nbsp;<br>Don&apos;t forget to register before 4 p.m. on Thursday, December 18, to be considered for sweet prizes. Bring LOTS of candy to throw out to the attendees watching you roll by!</p><p>Link to register - <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2025-Yuletide-Golf-Cart-Parade-Registrat-159" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsYuletide Golf Cart Parade Headline</span></a><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsYuletide Golf Cart Parade Headline</span></p><p>After the parade wraps up, head over to Neal &amp; Pam&apos;s for the announcement of the Yuletide Golf Cart Parade winners. Please note that only registered participants are eligible for prizes. Let&apos;s roll!</p><p id="isPasted">For more information, visit <a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/178/Events">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/178/Events</a><br>For parking information, visit <a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking</a><br>For town merchandise, visit <a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/341/Town-of-Surfside-Beach-Merchandise">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/341/Town-of-Surfside-Beach-Merchandise</a></p><p id="isPasted">Vendors:&nbsp;<br>There are no vendors at this event.&nbsp;<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website, <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Roads closed during the parade: 12:30 pm to 2:00 pm&nbsp;</strong><br>Ocean Blvd S from 16th Ave S to Surfside Drive<br>Surfside Dr from Ocean Blvd to Hollywood Drive<br>All side streets along Ocean Blvd S<br>All side streets along Surfside Drive to Hollywood Drive&nbsp;<br><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4660" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="2025 Yuletide GC Parade 122025"></p><p><br></p><p>#thefamilybeach #surfsidebeachsc #onetownoneteam&nbsp;</p>
