e-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Festival Vendors:<br>Food Vendor Application:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">CLICK HERE<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"></a><br><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendor Application:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Art-Crafts-Vendor-For-166" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">CLICK HERE<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>.<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website, <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</p><p><br></p>
