+        <p id="isPasted">It&apos;s the 6th annual Celebrate Surfside Beach Festival. Music, food, fun, and Arts &amp; Crafts vendors. Admission is free!</p><div style='margin-inline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: "Segoe UI Historic", "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' data-pasted="true">Back for the 6th year it&apos;s the best little festival in Surfside Beach, the Celebrate Surfside Beach Festival. This charity fund raiser features, food, vendors, music and our always popular dunk tank. Big enough to be entertaining, small enough to make walking easy, put the Celebrate Surfside Beach Festival on your calendar.<br>This year we are raising money for the Grand Strand Humane Society, and Purchase a Pup for the PD, supporting the Surfside Beach Police Department new K-9 officer.</div><div style='margin-inline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: "Segoe UI Historic", "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>For a list of vendors, please go to our website,&nbsp;<a href="https://